#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Versioned report document shared by report builders and renderers."
msgstr "由报告构建器和渲染器共享的带版本报告文档。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Finds a section by key."
msgstr "按键查找节。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Finds a section by key for in-place modification."
msgstr "按键查找节以便就地修改。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Serializes the validated document as deterministic JSON."
msgstr "将校验后的文档序列化为确定性 JSON。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid ""
"Offline asset content is embedded as JSON string values and map keys are "
"emitted in sorted order."
msgstr "离线资源内容以 JSON 字符串值嵌入，映射键按排序顺序输出。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Serializes the validated document with offline asset content hashed."
msgstr "序列化校验后的文档，并对离线资源内容取哈希。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid ""
"Each asset value is replaced by its SHA-256 hexadecimal digest, so the "
"payload reflects asset identity without embedding the bytes."
msgstr "每个资源值替换为其 SHA-256 十六进制摘要，因此载荷反映资源身份而不嵌入字节。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Computes the provenance digest of the semantic payload."
msgstr "计算语义载荷的来源摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid ""
"The digest is SHA-256 over a versioned frame and semantic_payload(); report "
"renderers expose it as the report_digest bundle metadata."
msgstr "该摘要是对带版本的帧和 semantic_payload() 计算的 SHA-256；报告渲染器将其作为 report_digest 打包元数据公开。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Report domain, such as \"portfolio\", \"risk\" or \"factor\"."
msgstr "报告领域，例如 \"portfolio\"、\"risk\" 或 \"factor\"。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Document title."
msgstr "文档标题。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Ordered sections; keys must be unique."
msgstr "有序节列表；键必须唯一。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Free-form metadata."
msgstr "自由格式元数据。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid "Schema version; must equal report_document_schema_version to serialize."
msgstr "模式版本；序列化时必须等于 report_document_schema_version。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:19
msgid ""
"Embedded asset name to content mapping; to_json writes the content as string"
" values while semantic_payload writes its SHA-256 digest."
msgstr "嵌入的资源名称到内容映射；to_json 将内容写为字符串值，而 semantic_payload 写入其 SHA-256 摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:22
msgid "HTML rendering options."
msgstr "HTML 渲染选项。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:22
msgid "UI language: \"en\" or \"zh\"."
msgstr "界面语言：\"en\" 或 \"zh\"。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:22
msgid "Chart renderer for report series."
msgstr "报告序列的图表渲染器。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Named scalar metric with one optional typed value."
msgstr "带一个可选类型化值的命名标量指标。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Stable identifier used by section metadata."
msgstr "节元数据使用的稳定标识符。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Display label."
msgstr "显示标签。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Value unit, such as \"ratio\" or \"count\"."
msgstr "取值单位，例如 \"ratio\" 或 \"count\"。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Numeric value; takes precedence over boolean and text."
msgstr "数值；优先于布尔值和文本值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Boolean value used when number is unset."
msgstr "number 未设置时使用的布尔值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:25
msgid "Text value used when number and boolean are unset."
msgstr "number 与 boolean 均未设置时使用的文本值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "One titled group of metrics, tables, series and notes."
msgstr "一组带标题的指标、表格、序列和说明。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Serializes this section as deterministic JSON."
msgstr "将本节序列化为确定性 JSON。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid ""
"Every units and legends key must match a metric, table or series key in the "
"section, and their values must be non-empty."
msgstr "每个 units 和 legends 键都必须匹配本节中的指标、表格或序列键，且其值不能为空。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Document-unique section key."
msgstr "文档内唯一的节键。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28 ../../site/api/report.md:31
#: ../../site/api/report.md:37
msgid "Display title."
msgstr "显示标题。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Scalar metrics."
msgstr "标量指标。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Tables."
msgstr "表格。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Chart series."
msgstr "图表序列。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Free-form notes."
msgstr "自由格式说明。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Unit overrides keyed by a metric, table or series key in this section."
msgstr "按本节指标、表格或序列键索引的单位覆盖。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:28
msgid "Chart legends keyed by a series key in this section."
msgstr "按本节序列键索引的图例。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "Named numeric series for chart rendering."
msgstr "用于图表渲染的命名数值序列。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "Stable identifier used by legends and artifacts."
msgstr "图例与产物使用的稳定标识符。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "X-axis label."
msgstr "X 轴标签。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "Y-axis label."
msgstr "Y 轴标签。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "Value unit, such as \"ratio\" or \"growth_multiple\"."
msgstr "取值单位，例如 \"ratio\" 或 \"growth_multiple\"。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "X values; must have the same length as y."
msgstr "X 值；长度必须与 y 相同。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:31
msgid "Y values."
msgstr "Y 值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Static native replacement for a Matplotlib axis."
msgstr "Matplotlib 坐标轴的静态原生替代实现。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid ""
"The Python renderer returns one axis per section series, keyed "
"axis:<section>.<series>. The native artifact carries the same prepared "
"values; there is no Matplotlib object and no kernel recomputation."
msgstr ""
"Python 渲染器为每个节序列返回一个坐标轴，键为 axis:<section>.<series>。原生产物携带相同的预处理值；不存在 "
"Matplotlib 对象，也不会重新调用内核计算。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Name in the form \"axis:<section>.<series>\"."
msgstr "形如 \"axis:<section>.<series>\" 的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Source section key."
msgstr "来源节键。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Source series key."
msgstr "来源序列键。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "\"<section title>: <legend or series key>\"."
msgstr "\"<section title>: <legend or series key>\"。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Section legend for the series, or the series key when none is set."
msgstr "该序列的节图例；未设置图例时为序列键。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "X-axis label copied from the series."
msgstr "从序列复制的 X 轴标签。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Section unit for the series, or empty when none is defined."
msgstr "该序列的节单位；未定义时为空。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Same value as y_label."
msgstr "与 y_label 相同的值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "X values copied from the series."
msgstr "从序列复制的 X 值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "Y values copied from the series."
msgstr "从序列复制的 Y 值。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:34
msgid "False when the caller supplied the matching axis key."
msgstr "当调用方提供了匹配的坐标轴键时为 false。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:37
msgid "Named table of typed cells."
msgstr "由带类型单元格构成的命名表格。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:37
msgid "Stable identifier used by section metadata and renderers."
msgstr "节元数据与渲染器使用的稳定标识符。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:37
msgid "Column headers."
msgstr "列标题。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:37
msgid "Rows; each row must have columns.size() cells when serialized."
msgstr "数据行；序列化时每行必须包含 columns.size() 个单元格。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:40
msgid "Worksheet naming options for render_xlsx."
msgstr "render_xlsx 的工作表命名选项。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:40
msgid "Prefix prepended to each section key to form worksheet names."
msgstr "拼接在每个节键之前以构成工作表名称的前缀。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:43
msgid "Chart renderer used by render_html."
msgstr "render_html 使用的图表渲染器。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:43
msgid "Draw each series as an inline SVG polyline."
msgstr "将每个序列绘制为内联 SVG 折线。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:43
msgid "Embed the pinned offline ECharts 5.5.0 script and chart payloads."
msgstr "嵌入固定版本的离线 ECharts 5.5.0 脚本和图表载荷。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:46
msgid "Builds a portfolio report document from prepared return and position data."
msgstr "基于预处理收益率与持仓数据构建组合报告文档。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:46
msgid ""
"The document has domain \"portfolio\". It always contains a \"performance\" "
"section, adds a \"benchmark\" section when benchmark is supplied, adds a "
"\"portfolio\" section when positions is supplied, and adds a "
"\"transactions\" section when transactions is non-empty. Metrics are "
"computed once from the supplied inputs; renderers do not recompute them."
msgstr ""
"该文档的领域为 \"portfolio\"。它始终包含一个 \"performance\" 节；提供 benchmark 时追加 "
"\"benchmark\" 节；提供 positions 时追加 \"portfolio\" 节；transactions 非空时追加 "
"\"transactions\" 节。指标依据输入计算一次；渲染器不会重新计算。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:49
msgid "Builds a risk validation report document from a walk-forward VaR report."
msgstr "基于滚动前向 VaR 报告构建风险验证报告文档。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:49
msgid ""
"The document has domain \"risk\" and one \"risk_validation\" section with "
"the walk-forward status, forecast and refit counts, optional diagnostics and"
" backtest metrics, forecast-event and refit tables, and the report "
"disclosure as a note."
msgstr ""
"该文档的领域为 \"risk\"，包含一个 \"risk_validation\" "
"节，其中有滚动前向状态、预测与重新拟合计数、可选诊断与回测指标、预测事件表和重新拟合表，以及以说明形式给出的报告披露。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:52
msgid "Projects prepared report series into one Bokeh-compatible document."
msgstr "将预处理的报告序列投影为一个兼容 Bokeh 的文档。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:52
msgid ""
"One line glyph per series, with the series key as the y field and the "
"section legend or \"<section title>: <series key>\" as the legend label. "
"Values are copied, not recomputed."
msgstr ""
"每个序列一个线图元，y 字段为序列键，图例标签为节图例或 \"<section title>: <series "
"key>\"。数值是复制而来，并非重新计算。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:55
msgid "Renders a report document as one self-contained HTML page."
msgstr "将报告文档渲染为一个自包含的 HTML 页面。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:55
msgid ""
"Text is HTML-escaped, styles are embedded, and no external asset URL is "
"referenced; the ECharts backend embeds the pinned chart script. Output is "
"deterministic for the same document and options."
msgstr "文本经过 HTML 转义，样式内嵌，不引用任何外部资源 URL；ECharts 后端会嵌入固定版本的图表脚本。相同文档与选项的输出是确定性的。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:58
msgid "Projects prepared report series into static Matplotlib-compatible axes."
msgstr "将预处理的报告序列投影为兼容 Matplotlib 的静态坐标轴。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:58
msgid ""
"supplied_axes lists \"<section>.<series>\" keys the caller already owns; "
"those artifacts are marked owned = false, matching the Python axes argument "
"ownership rule."
msgstr ""
"supplied_axes 列出调用方已拥有的 \"<section>.<series>\" 键；这些产物被标记为 owned = false，与 "
"Python 的 axes 参数所有权规则一致。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:61
msgid "Renders deterministic native PDF 1.4 bytes for a report document."
msgstr "为报告文档渲染确定性的原生 PDF 1.4 字节。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:61
msgid ""
"Includes text, headings, tables and simple line-series vector paths. Uses "
"base-14 Helvetica fonts; characters outside WinAnsi are replaced with ? "
"(declared format variance from the Chromium-backed Python writer)."
msgstr ""
"包含文本、标题、表格以及简单的折线序列矢量路径。使用 base-14 Helvetica 字体；WinAnsi 之外的字符替换为 ?（相对基于 "
"Chromium 的 Python 写入器已声明的格式差异）。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:64
msgid "Projects prepared report series into one Plotly-compatible document."
msgstr "将预处理的报告序列投影为一个兼容 Plotly 的文档。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:64
msgid ""
"One scatter trace per report_section::series entry; the trace name is the "
"section legend or \"<section title>: <series key>\". Values are copied, not "
"recomputed. report_series::x is numeric in the native model, so the Python "
"DatetimeIndex x-axis is a declared date-axis format variance."
msgstr ""
"每个 report_section::series 条目对应一个散点轨迹；轨迹名称为节图例或 \"<section title>: <series "
"key>\"。数值是复制而来，并非重新计算。原生模型中 report_series::x 为数值，因此 Python 的 DatetimeIndex X"
" 轴属于已声明的日期轴格式差异。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:67
msgid "Renders a report document as an in-memory XLSX workbook."
msgstr "将报告文档渲染为内存中的 XLSX 工作簿。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:67
msgid ""
"One worksheet is emitted per section. Worksheet names combine "
"options.sheet_prefix with the section key, replace invalid characters with "
"'_', and are capped at 31 characters; duplicates receive a \"_2\", \"_3\", "
"... suffix. An empty document produces a single worksheet named \"report\" "
"or the prefix when one is set. No file is written."
msgstr ""
"每个节生成一个工作表。工作表名称由 options.sheet_prefix 与节键组合而成，非法字符替换为 '_'，并截断至 31 "
"个字符；重复名称追加 \"_2\"、\"_3\" 等后缀。空文档只生成一个名为 \"report\" 的工作表，若设置了前缀则为该前缀。不会写入文件。"

#: ../../site/api/report.md:70
msgid "Writes the native PDF to target and returns the artifact bundle."
msgstr "将原生 PDF 写入 target 并返回产物包。"

